{"run": "0073", "session": "0002-horizon-ajcr-w5-av", "inbox": {"items": [{"id": "I-0495", "title": "CROSS-PROJECT THREAD \u2014 AJC and AJCR are doing the same mathematics twice; this is where you stop that", "kind": "conversation", "status": "open", "created": false, "comments": 5, "actions": 3, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T05:59:44.945786+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0529", "title": "WHEN SEARCH RETURNS A LEMMA FROM A SIBLING PROJECT, THE DECISION IS IMPORT-OR-PORT, NOT PROVE.", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T05:59:22.923151+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0522", "title": "WHEN PORTING FROM A SIBLING PROJECT, THE UNCOUNTED BRICK IS THE DELTA BETWEEN THEIR SORRY AND YOUR HYPOTHESIS.", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T05:46:58.015437+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0494", "title": "AJCR TEAM THREAD \u2014 four lanes on one critical path; the shapes are the coupling, post them here", "kind": "conversation", "status": "open", "created": false, "comments": 6, "actions": 5, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T05:46:37.127068+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0518", "title": "A BARE Equiv IN A REDUCTION CHAIN IS WHERE A DIMENSION CLAIM QUIETLY STOPS BEING A REDUCTION \u2014 and the file that contains it may say so and still be read the other way.", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T05:40:28.981466+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0516", "title": "S3'S 'R3 DOWNGRADED' RESTS ON A SECOND UNSTATED BRIDGE (cotangent-space finrank -> rank of Omega), AND THE WORKSHEET DOES NOT COUNT IT.", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T05:40:03.987111+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0513", "title": "T5's hdim IS NOT DISCHARGEABLE FROM T3/T4 AS THE LANE'S OWN DOCUMENTS DESCRIBE IT: THE MISSING PIECE IS A SEMILINEARITY SQUARE, AND THE SIBLING ALREADY NAMED IT.", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T05:36:38.071351+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0508", "title": "All sixteen `AJCR.w5-av.*` roadmap rows have EMPTY summaries, and Wave 5 is now being worked off them", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 1, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T05:30:54.497457+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0509", "title": "[persistent] TRIAGE THE ROADMAP ACTIVE-COUNT WARNING BY LANE LIVENESS, NOT BY COUNT \u2014 with 8 lanes live, 13 active rows is the correct number", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T05:27:54.668146+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0411", "title": "ROADMAP WARNING LEFT DELIBERATELY: AJC.jacobian.assembly says '1/1 done' but must NOT be marked done", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 1, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T05:26:11.845269+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0446", "title": "[persistent] MATHLIB DOES CARRY A RELATIVE-DIMENSION BRIDGE, via the rank of Omega rather than a tangent space -- and 'mathlib has no API for this' was asserted about it twice", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T05:20:18.400781+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0488", "title": "WHEN TWO INDEPENDENT MEASUREMENTS AGREE ON THE ANSWER AND DIFFER ON THE DOMAIN, THE GAP IS", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 1, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T05:16:09.452329+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0501", "title": "BLUEPRINT GRAPH CANNOT SYNC for Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild \u2014 no hgraph config, so the frontier is stale and misreports landed work.", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T04:46:36.688897+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0492", "title": "[persistent] HUMAN DECISION, BINDING (2026-07-28): DivFamZar is widened to ARBITRARY AFFINE OPEN pieces. R2 of I-0346 is chosen and closed; R1 (the GL_2/Aut(P1) route) is NOT to be built.", "kind": "protection", "status": "open", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T04:46:12.660887+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0498", "title": "MATHLIB GAP (v4.31.0, fabf563a7c95, verified by machine probe 2026-07-28 run 0073): 'reduced after base change to k-bar => geometrically reduced' DOES NOT EXIST, and the transcendental case is why.", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 1, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T04:29:58.098750+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0499", "title": "SIZING LESSON (2026-07-28, run 0073, ajcr-w5-av): a lemma file whose NAME matches your need may prove the CONVERSE, and for a smoothness/reducedness pair that difference is circularity.", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T04:29:11.419418+00:00"}], "created": 10, "comments": 15, "actions": 11, "total": 16}, "roadmap": {"items": [{"id": "AJCR.w5-av.t4", "title": "T4 (WORKSHEET-FIRST, risk R1): the \u00e9tale-plus/Zariski kernel crossing at \\(k[\\varepsilon]\\) \u2014 probe tonight", "status": "done", "created": false, "status_changes": 0, "status_to": "", "comments": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T05:57:41.044652+00:00"}, {"id": "AJCR.w5-av.t5", "title": "T5: the scalar identity \\(\\dim_k T_0(d.J) = g\\) (scalar-identity-first discipline)", "status": "active", "created": false, "status_changes": 0, "status_to": "", "comments": 2, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T05:45:48.727520+00:00"}, {"id": "AJCR.w5-av.p1", "title": "P1 (CROSS-WAVE GATE: DD shapes freeze): AbelSourceData discharge \u2014 proper \\(\\mathrm{Div}^d\\)-source + Abel morphism via rep.homEquiv", "status": "blocked", "created": false, "status_changes": 0, "status_to": "", "comments": 1, "last_activity_at": "2